Subject: Cantor EVO-X2 Scratch Build Executor P0 Acyclic Package Design

@ [design_uuid] 34870916-f7fd-4677-828a-bd87bc0f3018
@ [canonical_uuid] 935e020f-8c6f-49e4-b355-63eabd3b778b
@ [formation_signature_uuid] 610fe633-34ec-40a5-a95c-170d0cffb3c1
@ [local_core_bookend_commit] 1edd3a5596660b9789d7bf43eba82d2ee4917744

& [Problem]
  + the commission21 shape contains package_manifest_sha256 while the formation data design also says the package manifest binds the separately signed commission
  + one self-digested manifest cannot contain commission bytes whose digest transitively contains that same manifest digest without an ungoverned fixed-point construction
  + silently omitting either edge would weaken ESBE-005 ESBE-008 or ESBE-A02

& [AcyclicCustodyGraph]
  + layer1 implementation manifest is content addressed and binds the executor compiler verifiers harness predecessor request plan plan verification command set source archive and selected public evidence but excludes commission and deployment envelope
  + layer2 commission binds layer1 package_manifest_sha256 plus the independently self-digested command set and all exact commission21 authority fields
  + layer3 deployment envelope binds the exact layer1 manifest digest and layer2 commission digest and is the outer package-membership closure
  + dependency direction is artifact bytes to implementation manifest to commission to deployment envelope
  + independent verification begins at the outer envelope and walks only backward through those exact digest edges

& [CommandSet]
  + command set is provider-free host-free canonical JSON with exactly four ordered Cargo records for operation ordinals3 through6
  + each record binds kind observed_cargo executable role separate argument atoms exact workspace root and exact commission Cargo environment
  + runtime resolves observed_cargo only to the separately recorded existing-toolchain cargo_path and cargo_sha256
  + executor-owned operations1 2 and7 are fixed binary suboperations and are not ambient commands admitted by command-set data

& [PackageBoundary]
  + package root must be an ordinary nonreparse directory beneath an explicitly supplied bounded local build parent during construction and testing
  + implementation manifest paths are relative forward-slash visible ASCII coordinates with exact case-folded uniqueness and no root dot traversal link or alternate-data-stream form
  + actual package file membership is exactly implementation artifacts plus implementation_manifest.json commission.json and deployment_envelope.json
  + the source archive remains covered by the exact268435456-byte and16384-member admission bounds and its pinned SHA256

& [Authority]
  + this clarification changes no signed commission field operation grant denial bound root source identity acceptance claim or live authority
  + it makes the previously implicit outer package closure explicit and machine-verifiable
  + construction verification and adversarial fixtures remain provider-free host-free network-free and effectless
  - never: contact EVO-X2 transfer the archive create commissioned roots observe a remote toolchain execute Cargo or perform another live effect before package implementation publication equality and immediate bookend

& [Resolution]
  + the three-layer acyclic graph is the implementation interpretation of package manifest commission correspondence under the unchanged canonical specification
  + a verifier must refuse a commission placed inside layer1 manifest membership envelope omission digest mismatch extra file duplicate coordinate raw-byte noncanonical form authority mutation or command mutation
